      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خالأ القَوْمُ</span></b>  [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَأَ</span>] <i>The people,</i> or
<i>party,</i> or <i>company of men, left one thing, and
betook themselves to another.</i> (Th, K, TA.) [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَالَى</span>
(see 3 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خلو</span>) has a similar meaning.]

